declarations.description:
Boolean-or-`'auto'` tri-state (used by `show-pagination`). Absent → `fallback`;
`auto` → `'auto'`; `false` / `0` / `no` / `off` → `false`; any other value → `true`.
Property path: a boolean or `'auto'`.

