Handle the table-level mousedown. Returns nothing (drives DOM side effects);
the listener wrapper calls preventDefault / stopPropagation as needed
within each branch.

Show tooltip for an element. `text` is the content, or a resolver run when
the show delay elapses (so the content reflects the state at show time;
`null` shows nothing).
